			<div class="content" id="post-content-3563826">
									

<p>Thanks to Pecan, BenjaminStokes, bittermixin, The Great Hippo, Rikks and many others for helping me with this skip through its many stages. I stole most of the formatting from qntm's SCP-3125, and MatthewMueller from JSFiddle for the typewriting code.</p>
<hr />
<p>Protip for re-readers: if you click on the warning, the collapsible shows up immediately. If you click on the &quot;verifying personnel clearance&quot; thingamobobber, the selector shows up immediately. This was the only thing keeping me sane while debugging this bad boy.</p>
<hr />
<p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ijFm6DxNVyI">Inspiration</a></p>
<p>Edit: I'd like to bring attention to a <a href="http://scp-jp.wikidot.com/scp-3747">Japanese translation</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/efu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2835717); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2835717&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1528736426" alt="EFU" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2835717)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/efu" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2835717); return false;">EFU</a></span> and a <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-3747">Chinese translation</a> by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rakish-rambler" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3092049); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3092049&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1528736426" alt="Rakish_Rambler" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3092049)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/rakish-rambler" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3092049); return false;">Rakish_Rambler</a></span>.</p>

